Hoisted `profile` and `profileIndex` into locals and marked the invalid cases as unlikely, keeping the common valid lookup on a straight-line path with a single index load. This reduces repeated member loads and improves branch layout without changing behavior.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    const auto* p = profile;
    if (__builtin_expect(p == NULL, 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;

    const FIT_UINT8 index = profileIndex;
    if (__builtin_expect(index >= p->numFields, 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;

    return p->fields[index].num;
}
```